{
  "id": "943",
  "title": "One Million Cats",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-05-31",
  "synopsis": "An old man and an old lady are getting a cat. But what will happen?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/943/14084410d33d205f3e0663c6dade190c6104f90a.mp3?1588496695",
  "series": {
    "title": "One Million Cats",
    "chapter": 7,
    "totalChapters": 9
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "    几分钟后，没有猫叫了。\n    老爷爷老奶奶走到门前一看，门前没有猫了。\n    “猫呢？”老奶奶问。\n    “我想，它们一只猫打一只猫，一只猫吃一只猫，猫都没有了！”老爷爷说。\n    “都没有了？”老奶奶很不高兴。\n    老爷爷这儿看看，那儿看看。他叫了起来：“你看！那里有一只！”\n    老爷爷和老奶奶看到车后面有一只小猫。",
    "traditional": "    幾分鐘後，沒有貓叫了。\n    老爺爺老奶奶走到門前一看，門前沒有貓了。\n    “貓呢？”老奶奶問。\n    “我想，它們一隻貓打一隻貓，一隻貓吃一隻貓，貓都沒有了！”老爺爺說。\n    “都沒有了？”老奶奶很不高興。\n    老爺爺這兒看看，那兒看看。他叫了起來：“你看！那裡有一隻！”\n    老爺爺和老奶奶看到車後面有一隻小貓。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "几分钟后，没有猫叫了。",
      "traditional": "幾分鐘後，沒有貓叫了。",
      "pinyin": "jǐ fēn zhōng hòu méi yǒu māo jiào le",
      "english": "A few minutes later, the cats had stopped shouting."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "老爷爷老奶奶走到门前一看，门前没有猫了。",
      "traditional": "老爺爺老奶奶走到門前一看，門前沒有貓了。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo yé ye lǎo nǎi nai zǒu dào mén qián yí kàn mén qián méi yǒu māo le",
      "english": "The old man and the old lady went to have a look in front of the door. There were no cats in front of the door anymore."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "“猫呢？”老奶奶问。",
      "traditional": "“貓呢？”老奶奶問。",
      "pinyin": "māo ne lǎo nǎi nai wèn",
      "english": "“What about the cats?” the old lady asked."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "“我想，它们一只猫打一只猫，一只猫吃一只猫，猫都没有了！”老爷爷说。",
      "traditional": "“我想，它們一隻貓打一隻貓，一隻貓吃一隻貓，貓都沒有了！”老爺爺說。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng tā men yì zhī māo dǎ yì zhī māo yì zhī māo chī yì zhī māo māo dōu méi yǒu le lǎo yé ye shuō",
      "english": "“I think, they cat by cat hit each other, cat by cat ate each other, and all the cats are gone!” the old man said."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "“都没有了？”老奶奶很不高兴。",
      "traditional": "“都沒有了？”老奶奶很不高興。",
      "pinyin": "dōu méi yǒu le lǎo nǎi nai hěn bù gāo xìng",
      "english": "“All gone?” the old lady was very unhappy."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "老爷爷这儿看看，那儿看看。他叫了起来：“你看！那里有一只！”",
      "traditional": "老爺爺這兒看看，那兒看看。他叫了起來：“你看！那裡有一隻！”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo yé ye zhè‘r kàn kan nà'r kàn kan tā jiào le qǐ lái nǐ kàn nà lǐ yǒu yì zhī",
      "english": "The old man looked here, and looked there. He started shouting, “Look! There is one over there!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "老爷爷和老奶奶看到车后面有一只小猫。",
      "traditional": "老爺爺和老奶奶看到車後面有一隻小貓。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo yé ye hé lǎo nǎi nai kàn dào chē hòu miàn yǒu yì zhī xiǎo māo",
      "english": "The old man and the old lady saw that there was a small cat behind a car."
    },
